WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.010
We have Mabel Cadena,
who plays Namora.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.810
This is your first red carpet.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:05.610
How do you feel?

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.558
[INAUDIBLE] I feel excited.

00:00:07.558 --> 00:00:09.020
I feel nervous.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.800
It's a lot of
emotions right now.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.830
But I'm happy.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.810
Yeah, that's amazing.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.210
You are coming into
the MCU real strong.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.810
[LAUGHING] What was
it like training to be

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:21.860
such a powerhouse character?

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.660
Oh.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.770
Well, it was a lot.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.340
We spend one year training.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:33.590
Physical, mental, and
we are freediving.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.900
We hold our breath under water.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.600
We made an amazing job there.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.080
So it was really hard actually.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.920
Really, really hard.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.300
Well, we actually
hear that you hold

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.900
your breath, your first
time that you went down,

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.020
it was 8 minutes.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.683
Well, it was 6 and 1/2.

00:00:49.683 --> 00:00:50.750
We're going to round that now.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:51.560
We're going to
give you the eight.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.360
You deserve it.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.960
Oh, [LAUGHING] yes.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.020
No, but Tenoch actually
did an amazing job, too.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.560
Was actually five minutes, I
think, or something like that.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.880
The dedication that
you have to that.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.790
And speaking of the
dedication, we've

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.220
seen in the trailer, blue skin.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:10.130
Now we want to know, there's
some cosplayers out here.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.240
They've painted their skin blue.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.340
Did you have to do
that, or was it CGI?

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.810
What was that process like?

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:18.935
Well, I spent six hours for
that process, for being blue.

00:01:18.935 --> 00:01:21.500
[LAUGHING] Six hours.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.260
And actually we are
starting eight hours.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:30.470
And well, the final
time was six hours,

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:34.650
but maybe you can see in
the movie another Namora.

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:35.730
With other skin.

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:36.530
I don't know.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:37.490
So.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.130
I love the teaser,
the mystery there.

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:40.940
A little tea.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:41.750
That's good.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:43.010
Let's see what's happened.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.420
Yes, we're into it.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:49.190
Now, tell us what it was like
to play a woman from a really

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:50.840
powerful cultural background.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.990
We know that Namora is all
about protecting her people.

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:56.000
Give us a little insight
into that experience.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.800
Ooh, it's a lot.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.810
Because I think thanks for the
legacy, the Chadwick legacy,

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:07.250
to nudge Alex and me, now
we have the opportunity

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:11.930
to represent our cultural,
our Latin culture, so

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:15.680
as a Mexican woman, it's
an amazing experience.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.690
I can play Namora
in this universe,

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:25.940
you know, because we in
Mexico, see a lot of faces.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:31.910
So I'm very proud that people
like me, like with my face,

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.540
with my skin, with
my other culture

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.810
can be in this huge platform.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.260
So I'm very excited about it.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.060
Yes.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.520
Yes, the fans are
also equally excited.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.140
They love you so much.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.210
They're excited for the splash.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.630
I'm sorry.
I had to.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.710
The splash you're going to make.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:49.510
I'm sorry.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.177
Bad jokes here, but thank
you so much for spending

00:02:51.177 --> 00:02:51.977
your time out here.

00:02:51.977 --> 00:02:53.340
Everybody wants to
go and talk to you,

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.650
so we're going to
send you on your way.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.900
Have a great night.
Congratulations.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:56.900
Thank you so much.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.310
Thank you, Mabel Cadena.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.930
Say goodbye to the Marvel fans.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.380
Thank you, everyone.

